LC 28 — Find Index of First Occurrence
Pattern:String Traversal

Logic:
Check where needle starts inside haystack.
C++ find() gives the starting index.
If not found → -1.

Algorithm:
Find needle inside haystack
If found → return index
Otherwise → return -1

CODE:
class Solution {
public:
    int strStr(string haystack, string needle) {
        return haystack.find(needle);
    }
};

EX:
haystack = "sadbutsad"
needle = "sad"

"sad" starts at index 0

Answer = 0 ✅
